  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=256, C5=0.3808989437\nInterpolated to n=512: C5=0.3813816713\n\n--- Phase 1: Subgradient momentum ---\n  C5=0.3810249415 (took 0.0s)\n\n--- Phase 2: SLSQP active set ---\n  C5=0.3810249415 (took 190.9s)\n\n--- Phase 3: Targeted swap search ---\n  C5=0.3810174929 (took 9.7s)\n\n--- Phase 4: SLSQP polish ---\n  C5=0.3810174929 (took 54.7s)\n\n--- Phase 5: Perturbation exploration ---\n  C5=0.3810174929 (took 114.5s)\n\n--- Phase 6: More local search ---\n  C5=0.3810066320 (took 8.8s)\n\n--- Phase 7: Higher resolution (n=1024) ---\n  Interpolated n=1024: C5=0.3810352225\n  After subgrad: C5=0.3810156959\n  Final n=1024: C5=0.3810138177 (took 127.7s)\n\n--- Phase 8: Multi-start ---\n  C5=0.3810066320 (took 48.5s)\n\n--- Phase 9: Final polish ---\n  C5=0.3810066320\n  After final local search: C5=0.3810065853\n\nFINAL: n=512, C5=0.3810065853",
